- **Problem:** Verbose titles in custom dialogs could be vertically clipped instead of remaining readable.
- **Change:** Allow the message container and title to shrink, and constrain titles to one line with an ellipsis.

```css
.dialog-message-text {
	min-width: 0;
	overflow: hidden;
	text-overflow: ellipsis;
	white-space: nowrap;
}
```

